---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTA from '../../../components/CTA.astro';
---
<Layout title="Legal Resources | López Márquez Abogados Barcelona" description="Practical legal resources in English about dismissal, immigration, Spanish nationality, permanent disability and other high-intent legal questions for clients in Barcelona and Spain.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Resources" title="Practical legal guides for the questions that usually need an answer first." description="Start with the situation you are facing, check the dates and documents that matter, then move to the relevant service or contact the firm for a case-specific review." primaryLabel="Contact the firm" primaryHref="/en/contact" secondaryLabel="Latest legal updates" secondaryHref="/en/legal-updates" />
<section class="section section-paper"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">High-intent guides</span><h2>Find the question that matches your situation.</h2></div><p>You do not need to know the legal name of the procedure. The guides start from the problem a client is usually trying to solve.</p></div><div class="resource-grid">
<a class="resource" href="/en/resources/first-hours-after-dismissal"><span class="card-kicker">Employment · urgent</span><h3>What to do in the first hours after a dismissal</h3><p>Preserve the dismissal letter, record the notification date and keep the documents connected with the end of employment.</p><span class="link-arrow">Read the first steps →</span></a>
<a class="resource" href="/en/resources/dismissal-deadline-spain"><span class="card-kicker">Employment · deadline</span><h3>How long do you have to challenge a dismissal in Spain?</h3><p>Understand the general 20-working-day rule and why the exact notification date matters.</p><span class="link-arrow">Check the deadline guide →</span></a>
<a class="resource" href="/en/resources/permanent-disability-employment-2025"><span class="card-kicker">Employment · 2025 reform</span><h3>Permanent disability and employment: what changed?</h3><p>Understand the 2025 reform on permanent incapacity, workplace adjustments and the employment relationship.</p><span class="link-arrow">Read the guide →</span></a>
<a class="resource" href="/en/resources/arraigo-two-years-spain"><span class="card-kicker">Immigration · current rules</span><h3>Does arraigo in Spain still require three years?</h3><p>See the current two-year framework for the forms of arraigo that depend on a residence period, and the other requirements that remain relevant.</p><span class="link-arrow">Read the arraigo guide →</span></a>
<a class="resource" href="/en/resources/spanish-nationality-residence-period"><span class="card-kicker">Nationality</span><h3>How long do you need to live in Spain before Spanish nationality?</h3><p>Check the general and reduced residence periods before assuming that one rule applies to everyone.</p><span class="link-arrow">Read the nationality guide →</span></a>
<a class="resource" href="/en/legal-updates"><span class="card-kicker">Legal updates</span><h3>Recent changes affecting employment and immigration</h3><p>Selected updates with a link to the official BOE source.</p><span class="link-arrow">See legal updates →</span></a>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Information vs. advice</span><h2>A guide can frame the issue. Your documents determine the next step.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p>Use these pages to identify the relevant dates, documents and questions. Where the answer depends on your individual circumstances, the useful next step is a case-specific review.</p><p><a href="/en/contact">Tell the firm what happened →</a></p></div></div></section>
<CTA title="Cannot find the exact situation?" text="Describe what happened, when it happened and what you need to resolve. You do not need to name the legal procedure." label="Contact the firm" />
</Layout>
